#ASSERT `s 51(1) the person purporting to act for the company is personally liable on the contract` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- "(2) Subsection (1) applies— (a) to the making of a deed under the law of England and Wales or Northern Ireland, and (b) to the undertaking of an obligation under the law of Scotland, as it applies to the making of a contract."
